<title>ITALY: Gross yield 6.90 pct on 3-month Italian T-bills.</title>
<headline>Gross yield 6.90 pct on 3-month Italian T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for the sale of 36.5 trillion lire of three, six and 12-month short-term Treasury bills (BOTs).</p>
<p>		 Gross yield  (last)    Avge price   (last)</p>
<p>    3-month     6.90	(7.02)    98.31	  (98.28)</p>
<p>    6-month     6.80	(6.99)    96.72	  (96.65)</p>
<p>    1-year	6.63	(6.97)    93.80	  (93.50)</p>
<p>Note: results compared with a previous auction on November 12.</p>
</text>
